reading the chart
  acts   enter open · + zoom in · - zoom out · T today · n notes · f filter by
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, G last row]
  full   [→/l later, ←/h earlier]
  full   [enter open this issue, + zoom in to a shorter period, - zoom out to a longer period, T centre the chart on today, n where these dates came from, f filter by a person, a status, a label]
narrowed by a term
  acts   enter open · + zoom in · - zoom out · T today · n notes · f filter by · ctrl+g clear
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up, pgdn page down, pgup page up, home first row, G last row]
  full   [→/l later, ←/h earlier]
  full   [enter open this issue, + zoom in to a shorter period, - zoom out to a longer period, T centre the chart on today, n where these dates came from, f filter by a person, a status, a label, ctrl+g clear filter]
nothing to chart
  acts   n notes
  full   [n where these dates came from]
nothing to chart and narrowed by a term
  acts   n notes · ctrl+g clear
  full   [n where these dates came from, ctrl+g clear filter]
the notes pane
  acts   n hide notes
  full   [↓/j down, ↑/k up]
  full   [n hide these notes]
